{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an arcade shoot'em up with unique power-infusion gameplay. Face down an unknown army alone or with a friend in online or local co-op. Navigate the cosmos to save the remants of humanity, or join them in extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; Couch Co-op:</strong> Blast through the solar system with your wingman.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infusion Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Take control of the battlefield, infuse your enemies with different powerups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Paths:</strong>\u00a0Different level triggers let you access different routes on your way to The Core.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo System:</strong>\u00a0Switch up your attacks, power enemies up and don't stop blasting to keep your multiplier rising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong>\u00a0Show the world who's boss, no six-figure salary? What about a SEVEN-figure high score. Oof.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954600/extras/01db4e65e6f4b630f8059bd88a943919.poster.avif?t=1769007488\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954600/extras/01db4e65e6f4b630f8059bd88a943919.webm?t=1769007488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954600/extras/01db4e65e6f4b630f8059bd88a943919.mp4?t=1769007488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954600?t=1769007488","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa